{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45065","headline":"奉和袁使君高郡中新亭会张链师昼会二上人 · 皎然","name":"奉和袁使君高郡中新亭会张链师昼会二上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"置亭隐城堞，事简迹易幽。\n公性崇俭素，雅才非广求。\n傍檐竹雨清，拂案杉风秋。\n不移府中步，登兹如远游。\n坐觉诗思高，俯知物役休。\n虚寂偶禅子，逍遥亲道流。\n更闻临川作，下节安能酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}